WEBVTT

00:22:28.607 --> 00:22:31.132
heard each other speak
and were dazzled by each other.

00:22:31.156 --> 00:22:33.517
At the end of the speech,
we did the oddest thing.

00:22:33.541 --> 00:22:35.385
She's actually a very reserved person,

00:22:35.409 --> 00:22:38.187
but she kissed me on the lips,
and said, "I just love you,"

00:22:38.211 --> 00:22:39.693
I said, "I just love you, too."

00:22:39.717 --> 00:22:42.202
So put that aside,
because that's part of this story.

00:22:42.226 --> 00:22:43.999
In the meantime, I put away my novel.

00:22:44.023 --> 00:22:46.023
Something had come up in my personal life,

00:22:46.047 --> 00:22:49.825
and my then-partner was facing
being deported from the country.

00:22:49.849 --> 00:22:51.809
I had to marry him and leave the country.

00:22:51.833 --> 00:22:53.998
I ended up writing
an entirely different book,

00:22:54.022 --> 00:22:56.434
a memoir about that experience,
called "Committed,"

00:22:56.458 --> 00:22:57.613
put the novel away.

00:22:57.637 --> 00:22:58.882
After I wrote "Committed,"

00:22:58.906 --> 00:23:02.551
I returned to it with the hope
of restoring this work